schemaVersion: 1
id: tiktok-ads-root
name: TikTok Ads
kind: root
version: 0.1.0
description: >-
  Turn the files you already have about your company into TikTok ads. Fill in
  three placeholders (brand voice, product, audience) and a creative-lead agent
  writes hooks, briefs, and shot lists, then generates 9:16 video with native
  audio through the Google Gemini API using your own key. A growth-analyst agent
  owns the creative testing queue and the weekly learning loop. Text stages run
  on the Gemini free tier; video generation is paid and gated behind human
  approval. Nothing publishes anywhere.
entry: index.md
domain: Media
